    <string name="emergency_advice">Say where you are, the trail name and what happened. Stay where you are if you can, keep warm and keep your phone on. SMS works where there is too little signal for data.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_title">Before you use Vereda</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text">Mountain conditions on Madeira change quickly. Official closures and the rangers\' instructions always come first, even when the app shows a trail as open. Trail status comes from the official Visit Madeira page and can be late; routes and paths come from OpenStreetMap and nobody has checked them. Heights, times and daylight are estimates. You are responsible for your own safety: check the weather, tell someone your plan and turn back when in doubt. In an emergency call 112.</string>
